 ```
 
+#### Push notifications (optional)
+
+Fizzy can deliver notifications to your users' phones and desktops as web push notifications, which people turn on per device from their notification settings.
+Push messages are signed with a [VAPID](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8292) key pair, which you provide as `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`.
+You can generate a pair with:
+
+```sh
+docker run --rm ghcr.io/basecamp/fizzy:main bin/rails web_push:vapid_key
+```
+
+Keep the pair stable: browsers subscribe to the public key, so changing it means everyone has to turn notifications back on.
+Without a key pair, push notifications are unavailable.
+
